@host = http://localhost:5105
# Paste a Google ID token (from the browser's localStorage "idToken") to try authenticated calls.
@token = paste-token-here

### Liveness (no auth)
GET {{host}}/health

### Who am I / my organization
GET {{host}}/api/orgs/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### My chats
GET {{host}}/api/ai/sessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ask a question (streams a JSON array of text pieces)
POST {{host}}/api/ai/ask
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "query": "What are the support hours?", "sessionId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001" }
